cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite the manuscript and identify the repository commit used for verification."
type: software
repository-code: "https://github.com/Myyura/two-colour-crossing-complete-geometric-graphs"
title: "Two-colour crossing minimization in complete geometric graphs is NP-hard"
authors:
  - family-names: Myyura
    affiliation: The Kai Project
abstract: >-
  Manuscript, Lean formalization, and exact finite checks for the
  NP-hardness of minimizing monochromatic proper-crossing pairs in fixed
  complete geometric graphs with free two-colouring of all edges, and
  NP-completeness of the corresponding threshold decision problem.
keywords:
  - computational geometry
  - crossing number
  - NP-completeness
  - Lean
license:
  - Apache-2.0
  - CC-BY-4.0
